gametitle=Grand Theft Auto III (NTSC-U SLUS-20062 / CRC 5E115FB6)
comment=Work in progress. First Person and Right Stick Camera test build.
comment=Select + D-Pad Down toggles alternate cameras. Select cycles far, medium, near, first person on foot.
comment=Vehicles have three orbit distances. R3 looks behind temporarily. Hold native L1 (modern R1 on foot) to center.
comment=Cold boot and memory-card load required. Disable the older standalone First Person cheat.
comment=Supports stock controls, the recognized Zeroable remapper, and the existing GTA III Map Toggle.
comment=Camera port based on the Zeroable Vice City reference. Controller remapper foundation: pelvicthrustman.
[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Right Stick Camera and First Person\Enable]
author=Zeroable
description=Select + D-Pad Down toggles. Select cycles far/medium/near/first person on foot; vehicles have orbit only. R3 is temporary rear view. Native L1 (modern R1 on foot) smoothly centers. Requires a cold boot. Do not enable the older First Person cheat.
