[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\Right Stick Camera and First Person\Universal Invert Vertical]
author=Zeroable
description=Requires Enable above, but works with the alternate camera set OFF as well as ON. Reverses player-one right-stick vertical input for native views, aiming, and the alternate cameras. Horizontal input is unchanged.
